307=70.	but the light was scorching hot to me. 
311=71.	I approached that shade, but I was covered with a storm. 
315=72.	My honeyed mouth became scum. 
319=73.	My ability to soothe moods vanished. 

{74 = 74-80}
323=74.	@wDN{Suen}, tell @wDN{An} about @wRN{Lugal-Ane} and my fate! May @wDN{An} undo it for me! 
327=75.	As soon as you tell @wDN{An} about it, @wDN{An} will release me. 
