335=77.	foreign lands and flood lie at her feet. The woman too is exalted, 
339=78.	and can make cities tremble. 
343=79.	Step forward, 
347=80.	so that she will cool her heart for me. 

{81 = 81-90}
351=81.	I, @wPN{En-ḫedu-ana}, will recite a prayer to you. To you, holy @wDN{Inana}, 
