{91 = 91-108}
394=91.	My good divine wild cow, drive out the man, capture the man! 
398=92.	In the place of divine encouragement, what is my standing now? 
402=93.	May @wDN{An} extradite the land which is a malevolent rebel against your @wDN{Nanna}! 
406=94.	May @wDN{An} smash that city! May @wDN{Enlil} curse it! 
410=95.	May its plaintive child not be placated by his mother! 
414=96.	Lady, with the laments begun, 
418=97.	may your ship of lamentation be abandoned in hostile territory. 
422=98.	Must I die because of my holy songs? 
426=99.	My @wDN{Nanna} has @varh[t4072.v14]{paid no heed to me } @vart[t4072.v15,t4072.v14]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} has not decided my case }. He has destroyed me utterly in renegade territory. 
