437=101.	What is it to me if he has pronounced it? 
441=102.	What is it to me if he has not pronounced it? 
445=103.	He stood there in triumph and drove me out of the temple. 
449=104.	He made me fly like a swallow from the window; 
453=105.	I have exhausted my life-strength. 
457=106.	He made me walk through the thorn bushes of the mountains. 
